<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0002_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A standardised, often quantitative test or metric used to evaluate and compare the performance of AI systems on a fixed set of tasks designed to represent real- world usage" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0002_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0002_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0002_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Benchmarks" .
