<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A technique for visualising risk quantitatively and qualitatively, providing clear differentiation between proactive and reactive risk management, intended to help prevent and mitigate major accident hazards. Oil companies and national governments use the bowtie method." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0003_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Bowtie Method" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17805"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
