<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0003_Bengio2025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A0003_Bengio2025> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "The idea that multiple independent and overlapping layers of defence can be implemented such that if one fails, others will still be effective. An example comes from the field of infectious diseases, where multiple preventative measures (e.g. vaccines, masks, hand washing) can layer to reduce overall risk." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0004_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Defence in Depth" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17805"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0004_Bengio2025> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
