<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0005_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "There are numerous documentation best practices, guidelines, and requirements for AI systems to track e.g. training data, model design and functionality, intended use cases, limitations, and risks. Model cards’ and ‘system cards’ are examples of prominent AI documentation standards" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0005_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0005_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0005_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Documentation" .
