<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0005_Bengio2025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A0005_Bengio2025> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0006_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Domain experts, users, and impacted communities have unique insights into likely risks. There are emerging guidelines for participatory and inclusive AI." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0006_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0006_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0006_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Engagement with Relevant Experts and Communities" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0006_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17805"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
