<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0007_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A set of technical and organisational protocols and commitments to manage risks at varying levels as AI models become more capable. Some companies developing general- purpose AI employ these types of commitments as responsible scaling policies or similar frameworks." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0007_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0007_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0007_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "If-Then Commitments" .
