<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0008_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A tool used to assess the potential impacts of a technology or project. The EU AI Act requires developers of high- risk AI systems to carry out Fundamental Rights Impact Assessments." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0008_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0008_Bengio2025" .
