<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0010_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Processes to assess and measure an AI system's performance on a particular task. There are countless AI evaluations to assess different capabilities and risks, including for security." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0010_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0010_Bengio2025" .
