<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0011_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "An exercise in which a group of people or automated systems pretend to be an adversary and attack an organisation’s systems in order to identify vulnerabilities." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0011_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0011_Bengio2025" .
