<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0013_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A risk management tool that serves as a repository of all risks, their prioritisation, owners, and mitigation plans. They are sometimes used to fulfil regulatory compliance. Risk registers are a relatively standard tool used across many industries, including cybersecurity and recently AI." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0013_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0013_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0013_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Risk Register" .
