<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0014_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A way to categorise and organise risks across multiple dimensions. There are several well- known risk taxonomies for AI." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0014_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0014_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0014_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Risk Taxonomy" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0014_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.17805"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
