<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0015_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Quantitative or qualitative limits that distinguish acceptable from unacceptable risks and trigger specific risk management actions when exceeded. Risk thresholds for general- purpose AI are being determined by a combination of assessments of capabilities, impact, compute, reach, and other factors." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0015_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0015_Bengio2025" .
