<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0016_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "The level of risk an organisation is willing to take on. In AI, risks tolerances are often left up to AI companies, but regulatory regimes can help identify unacceptable risks that are legally prohibited" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0016_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0016_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0016_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Risk Tolerance" .
