<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0017_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Helps understand the dependencies between components and the system that they are part of, in order to anticipate how component failures could lead to system-level hazards. This approach is used across safety- critical fields, e.g. to anticipate and prevent aircraft crashes or nuclear reactor core meltdowns" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0017_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0017_Bengio2025" .
