<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0018_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Safety cases require developers to demonstrate safety. A safety case is a structured argument supported by evidence that a system is acceptably safe to operate in a particular context. Safety cases are common in many industries, including defence, aerospace, and railways." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0018_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0018_Bengio2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0018_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Safety Cases" .
