<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0019_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "An approach that requires engineers to provide evidence that a system is safe when operating as intended. This approach is used in many engineering fields, such as in the construction and testing of road vehicles." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0019_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0019_Bengio2025" .
