<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0020_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Developing plausible future scenarios and analysing how risks materialise. Scenario analysis and planning are widely used across industries including for the energy sector and to address uncertainties of power systems." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0020_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0020_Bengio2025" .
