<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0021_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A process to identify threats and vulnerabilities to a system. Threat modelling is commonly used to support AI security throughout AI research and development" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0021_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0021_Bengio2025" .
