<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0022_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Whistleblowers can play an important role in alerting authorities to dangerous risks at AI companies due to the proprietary nature of many AI advancements. Incentives and protections for whistleblowers are expected to be an important part of advanced AI risk governance." .
