<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0024_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "There is a spectrum of release and deployment strategies for AI including staged releases, cloud- based or API access, deployment safety controls, and acceptable use policies. There are some emerging industry practices that focus on release and deployment strategies for general- purpose AI." .
