<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0025_Bengio2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "A visual tool that helps prioritise risks according to their likelihood of occurrence and potential impact. Risk matrices are used in many industries and for many purposes, such as by financial institutions for evaluating credit risk, or by companies to assess possible disruptions to their supply chains" .
