<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0032_Casper2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Developers can be required to conduct and report on internal risk assessments of frontier systems." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0032_Casper2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0032_Casper2025" .
