<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0062_Eisenberg2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Establish and enforce policies governing system AI scaling decisions, including risk assessment requirements, capability thresholds, and deployment constraints. Define clear criteria for when and how system capabilities can be expanded based on safety considerations." .
