<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0065_Eisenberg2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Deploy comprehensive measures to verify user identity, document intended use cases, and ensure AI system usage complies with instructions. This includes KYC procedures for user verification, clear documentation of permitted uses, and user acknowledgment of instructions." .
