<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0178_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should run evaluations to assess their models’ dangerous capabilities (e.g. misuse potential, ability to manipulate, and power-seeking behavior)." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0178_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0178_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0178_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Dangerous capability evaluations" .
