<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0179_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Critical decisions in model development and deployment should be made by at least two people (e.g. promotion to production, changes to training datasets, or modifications to production).*" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0179_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0179_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0179_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Dual control" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0179_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07153"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
