<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0180_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should have and practice implementing an emergency response plan. This might include switching off systems, overriding their outputs, or restricting access." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0180_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0180_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0180_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Emergency response plan" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0180_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07153"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
