<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0182_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should only gradually increase the amount of compute used for their largest training runs." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0182_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0182_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0182_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Gradual scaling" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0182_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07153"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
