<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0182_Schuett2023> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A0182_Schuett2023> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0183_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should increase the level of external scrutiny in proportion to the capabilities of their models." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0183_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0183_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0183_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Increasing levels of external scrutiny" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0183_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07153"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
