<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0184_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should share threat intelligence and information about security incidents with each other.*" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0184_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0184_Schuett2023" .
