<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0185_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should have an internal audit team, i.e. a team which assesses the effectiveness of the lab’s risk management practices. This team must be organizationally independent from senior management and report directly to the board of directors." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0185_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0185_Schuett2023" .
