<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0187_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should conduct know-your-customer (KYC) screenings before giving people the ability to use powerful models.*" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0187_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0187_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0187_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "KYC screening" .
