<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0188_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "The information security of AGI labs should be proportional to the capabilities of their models, eventually matching or exceeding that of intelligence agencies (e.g. sufficient to defend against nation states)." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0188_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0188_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0188_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Military-grade information security" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0188_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.07153"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0188_Schuett2023> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
