<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0189_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AGI labs should contain models with sufficiently dangerous capabilities (e.g. via boxing or air-gapping)." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0189_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0189_Schuett2023" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0189_Schuett2023> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Model containment" .
