<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0251_Wiener2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "When enacting a full shutdown, the developer shall take into account, as appropriate, the risk that a shutdown of the covered model, or particular covered model derivatives, could cause disruptions to critical infrastructure." .
