<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0284_Campos2025> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0284_Campos2025> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Continuous Monitoring of Risk Controls"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0284_Campos2025> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A0284_Campos2025> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0285_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Independent third parties should vet evaluation protocols. These third parties should also be granted permission and resources to independently perform their evaluations, verifying the accuracy of the results." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0285_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0285_Campos2025" .
