<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0286_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Best practices from other industries include the establishment of clear risk ownership, with designated senior managers responsible for specific risks…" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0286_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0286_Campos2025" .
