<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0333_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "The senior managers making risk decisions need to be distinct from those advising on the decisions, to avoid conflicts of interest" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0333_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0333_Campos2025" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0333_Campos2025> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Separate Risk Ownership and Advisory Roles" .
