<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0407_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Consider the following factors when decommissioning GAI systems: Data retention requirements; Data security, e.g., containment, protocols, Data leakage after decommissioning; Dependencies between upstream, downstream, or other data, internet of things (IOT) or AI systems; Use of open-source data or models; Users' emotional entanglement with GAI functions." .
