<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0439_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Establish incident response plans for third-party GAI technologies: Align incident response plans with impacts enumerated in MAP 5.1; Communicate third-party GAI incident response plans to all relevant AI Actors; Define ownership of GAI incident response functions; Rehearse third-party GAI incident response plans at a regular cadence; Improve incident response plans based on retrospective learning; Review incident response plans for alignment with relevant breach reporting, data protection, data privacy, or other laws." .
