<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0444_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "When identifying intended purposes, consider factors such as internal vs. external use, narrow vs. broad application scope, fine-tuning, and varieties of data sources (e.g., grounding, retrieval-augmented generation)." .
