<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0445_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Determine and document the expected and acceptable GAI system context of use in collaboration with socio-cultural and other domain experts, by assessing: Assumptions and limitations; Direct value to the organization; Intended operational environment and observed usage patterns; Potential positive and negative impacts to individuals, public safety, groups, communities, organizations, democratic institutions, and the physical environment; Social norms and expectations." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0445_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0445_NIST2024" .
