<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0707_NIST2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0707_NIST2024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Harmful Bias and Homogenization Assessment"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0707_NIST2024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A0707_NIST2024> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0708_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Identify the classes of individuals, groups, or environmental ecosystems which might be impacted by GAI systems through direct engagement with potentially impacted communities." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0708_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0708_NIST2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0708_NIST2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Assessments for Environmental; Harmful Bias and Homogenization" .
