<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0852_UK_Government2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Ensure that a programme of monitoring and review is in place to enable potential security issues, or personal issues that may impact on an employee's work, to be recognised and dealt with effectively throughout their career" .
