<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0859_UK_Government2023> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0859_UK_Government2023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Vulnerability Reports for Bias and Discrimination"@en .
