<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0877_UK_Government2023> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Improving our ability to prevent criminal behaviour through the use of AI systems (e.g. fraud, online child sexual abuse)" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A0877_UK_Government2023> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A0877_UK_Government2023" .
