<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1018_Uuk2024> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1018_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#OrganisationalMitigation> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1018_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1018_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Advanced model access for vetted external researchers"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1018_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A1018_Uuk2024> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "State-of-the-art methods such as adversarial training to make models robust to adversarial attacks (e.g., jailbreaking)." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1019_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Adversarial Robustness" .
