<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#TechnicalMitigation> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1019_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Adversarial Robustness"@en .
