<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Clear and user-friendly bug bounty programs that acknowledge and reward individuals for reporting model vulnerabilities and dangerous capabilities." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1020_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Bug bounty programs" .
