<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://example.org/airkg#OrganisationalMitigation> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Bug bounty programs"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1020_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A1020_Uuk2024> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1021_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Restricting risky capabilities of deployed models, such as advanced autonomy (e.g., self-assigning new sub-goals, executing long-horizon tasks) or tool use functionalities (e.g., function calls, web browsing)." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1021_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1021_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1021_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Capability restrictions" .
