<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1021_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A1021_Uuk2024> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Careful data curation prior to all development stages (including fine-tuning) to filter out high-risk content and ensure the training data is sufficiently high-quality." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1022_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Data curation" .
