<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Data curation"@en .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1022_Uuk2024> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch> <https://w3id.org/ai-atlas-nexus/A1022_Uuk2024> .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1023_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Starting with a small number of applications and fewer users, and gradually scaling up API-access as rigorous monitoring increases confidence in the model's safety. An API-mediated staged release would also be required before open-sourcing a model." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1023_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1023_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1023_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Deploying powerful models in stages" .
