<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1024_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Bringing in external AI evaluation firms before deployment to assess and red-team the company's execution of dangerous capabilities evaluations." .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1024_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "A1024_Uuk2024" .
<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1024_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "External assessment of testing procedure" .
