<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1026_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "State-of-the-art reinforcement learning and fine-tuning techniques, such as Reinforcement Learning from Human Feedback (RLHF) or Direct Preference Optimization (DPO), to ensure models do not engage in unsafe behavior." .
