<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1027_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Monitoring for dangerous outputs (e.g., code that appears to be malware or viral genome sequences) and inputs that violate acceptable use policies to ensure models do not engage in harmful behavior." .
