<http://example.org/airkg/mitigation/A1028_Uuk2024> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Assessing and monitoring AI models with regard to red-line risk or capability thresholds set by a third-party, such as a standardization organization or regulator. Companies would further need to make technical, legal, and organizational preparations to halt development and deployment immediately when a breach occurs." .
