<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-discriminatory-actions-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "AI agents can take actions where one group of humans is unfairly advantaged over another due to the decisions of the model. This may be caused by AI agents' biased actions that impact the world, in the resources consulted, and in the resource selection process. For example, an AI agent can generate code that can be biased." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-discriminatory-actions-agentic> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-discriminatory-actions-agentic" .
