<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-evasion-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Evasion attacks attempt to make a model output incorrect results by slightly perturbing the input data sent to the trained model." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-evasion-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "atlas-evasion-attack" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/atlas-evasion-attack> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Evasion attack" .
