<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://example.org/airkg#description> "Using AI systems to conduct large-scale disinformation campaigns, malicious surveillance, or targeted and sophisticated automated censorship and propaganda, with the aim to manipulate political processes, public opinion and behavior." .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://example.org/airkg#identifier> "4.1" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://example.org/airkg#name> "Disinformation, surveillance, and influence at scale" .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://example.org/airkg#source> "https://airisk.mit.edu/"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/license> <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> .
<http://example.org/airkg/risk/mit-ai-risk-subdomain-4.1> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://airisk.mit.edu/> .
